# Runtime/model checkpoints stay private; allow only direct task Markdown summaries.
checkpoints/
!docs/work/tasks/*/checkpoints/
docs/work/tasks/*/checkpoints/*
!docs/work/tasks/*/checkpoints/*.md
# A Markdown-looking directory must not expose nested contents.
docs/work/tasks/*/checkpoints/*/
